Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.41,0:21:54.81,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}哪怕被抱进卧室
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:54.81,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}bedroomに運び込まれても
