Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:04.15,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}思い出したように暴れ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.15,0:22:05.49,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}瞄准我的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.15,0:22:05.49,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}俺の頭めがけ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.49,0:22:07.29,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}摇摇晃晃站起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.49,0:22:07.29,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}立ち上がりふらつき
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.29,0:22:08.67,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}哭泣着向前倒下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:08.67,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}泣きながら前のめりで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.67,0:22:10.27,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}趴在地上的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.67,0:22:10.27,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}倒れ込む姿は
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.27,0:22:11.81,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}和早上的我一模一样 yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.27,0:22:11.81,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}朝方の俺そのまま yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.99,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}快睡吧直到能用双手赢得夜晚为止
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.99,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}眠れその手で夜を勝ち取れるまで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.32,0:22:18.20,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}快睡吧直到夜色停留在你眼前为止
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.32,0:22:18.20,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}眠れその目の前で夜が足止めるまで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.48,0:22:21.30,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}到时候就玩耍吧！起舞直到早晨到来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:21.30,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}そん時は遊ぼうぜ！踊れ朝が来るまで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.64,0:22:24.59,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}在此之前不会让步夜晚将被我独占ah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.64,0:22:24.59,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}譲れんまだそれまで独り占めにする ah yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.74,0:22:26.41,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}再一会就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:26.41,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}あと少しだけ…
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.13,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}再一曲就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.13,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}あと一曲だけ…
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.13,0:22:30.60,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}再一次就好…yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.13,0:22:30.60,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}あと一つだけ…yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.92,0:22:32.77,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}再一会就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:32.77,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}あと少しだけ…
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.77,0:22:34.47,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}再一曲就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.77,0:22:34.47,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}あと一曲だけ…
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.47,0:22:35.79,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}再一次就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.47,0:22:35.79,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}あと一つだけ…
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.79,0:22:37.24,Song-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}直到能与彼此分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:37.24,Song-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.15}分かち合えるときまで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.50,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,芜 我有件事想不通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.50,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,カブラ 謎が一つあるんだけど
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.68,0:22:58.80,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,什么事？上面发大水 下面着大火？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:58.80,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,上は大水 下は大火事みたいな？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.80,0:23:00.14,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,那叫澡盆！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.80,0:23:00.14,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,それは風呂！
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.22,0:23:03.37,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,现在都用热水器了 谁还猜得出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.22,0:23:03.37,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,てか 自動給湯の世代にもう通用しないっつの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.37,0:23:04.74,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,哎呀 你不是知道嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.37,0:23:04.74,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,あら 知ってたのね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.74,0:23:05.83,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,这点小事…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:05.83,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,それくらい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.87,0:23:09.26,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,好吧 我也就刚好听过
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.87,0:23:09.26,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,まあ ギリ知ってるけど
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.54,0:23:11.46,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,不对 我不是问这个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.54,0:23:11.46,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,いや そういうことじゃなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.78,0:23:13.02,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,我是想问 你怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:13.02,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,なんでカブラが
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.14,0:23:15.24,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,跟小芹 妮可那帮闹腾的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.14,0:23:15.24,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,セリとかニコみたいな騒がしい連中と
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.24,0:23:16.62,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,玩到一块去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:16.62,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,付き合ってるのかってこと
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.81,0:23:19.82,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,也是 虽然都是吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:19.82,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,ああ 同じ吸血鬼とはいえ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.30,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,但确实不是一路人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.30,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,タイプが違うものね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.30,0:23:22.87,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,你这不是挺清楚的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.30,0:23:22.87,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,わかってんじゃん
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.25,0:23:25.27,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,为什么和她们来往啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:25.27,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,なぜ付き合ってるのか
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.69,0:23:26.67,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,因为呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:26.67,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,それはね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.03,0:23:28.67,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,跟她们待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.03,0:23:28.67,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,あの人たちといると
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.99,0:23:31.84,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,就觉得自己还挺正常的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:31.84,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,自分がまだまともだと思えるからよ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.96,0:23:32.44,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:32.44,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,え？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.07,0:23:33.56,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:33.56,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,え？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.59,0:23:35.64,Dial-CH,BDPreview,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1440,1022)}啊啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.59,0:23:35.64,Dial-JP,BDPreview,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(1440,1065)}ええ？
